              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo harér Manoa iri xwayluúr na/oó garmaawo, Manoa guri umií tsaát guri báy, Samson. Na/aywí iri uráy, AAKOÓ MUNGÚ na/aywí guri tsuúq. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
